  "description": "Built with a lightweight aluminum frame with a low stand-over height and dedicated Liv geometry, featuring 24-inch wheels for smaller riders, this all-rounder is ready for anything. It has a flat handlebar for a stable, upright riding position and comfortable gearing to make the big hills seem a little smaller. A protective chainguard keeps clothing from snagging in the drivetrain and dedicated youth components offer a perfect fit. Alight 24 is a great choice for navigating city streets or bike paths, where lightweight, good support, and the ability to carry speed more efficiently open up to fun. Safety and comfort come first with powerful brakes providing reliable slowing and stopping for busy areas where riding can be more unpredictable.",
